    "title": "Austin Police responding to deadly crash on East Riverside Dr. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tanya Nguyen ,\n1 hours ago\nAUSTIN (KXAN) — The Austin Police Department said they are on scene of a deadly crash on East Riverside Drive in southeast Austin.\nAustin Police said on social media all east bound lanes of E. Riverside Dr. between Royal Crest and Burton Drive are shut down due to a traffic fatality.\nPolice ask that drivers avoid the area and find an alternate route.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KXAN Austin.",
